   "text": "Padworth College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nPadworth College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nWe are a small sixth form international boarding college, offering a highly personalised education, preparing students from all over the world, aged 14 to 19 years, for entry to leading universities globally. Since we were established in 1963, we have helped thousands of students from the UK and overseas achieve excellent academic results and gain entry to some of the best universities in the UK. Situated on a beautiful campus, close to the university town of Reading and within a 50 mile radius of 40 universities, including 7 Russell Group institutions, we are a great place for students to live, learn and thrive.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 07:39\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n27/03/2026 07:39\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nHigh School\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £8,830.00\nMin: £7,525.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n80%\n80 of 100 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nInspiring Futures Education (IFE)\nFounded Year\n1963\nCampus(es)\nBerkshire\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n06/11/2024\nContract End Date\n05/11/2029\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.padworth.com/boarding/accommodation/\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.padworth.com/admissions/scholarships-bursaries/\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/PadworthCollege/playlists?app=desktop\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\nApplication Fee: £ 350",
